## Correction history

v1 proposed Mayol + Hydroxycitronellol (muguet register) as the heart's floating voice.
REJECTED: iris/orris is a cold register; muguet is also a cold register; the pair sums to
cold cosmetic powder (Prada Infusion d'Iris / Chanel No19 school) — the opposite of
Opus V's warm fatty iris. The floating voice must be WARM air: rose, jasmine, fruity-violet.

